Input: stmfts - bound FTS5 reads to queued events

A Mi 8 reported ten active slots at rest while 256-byte reads repeatedly
returned zero-pressure motion records. An 8-byte read returned an empty
FIFO on the same controller. Read the first event and request only the
remaining records indicated by the FTS5 FIFO count.

Decode the FTS5 event ID from the high nibble and continue past status and
user reports so later releases are handled. Select active multitouch
scanning and check that contact IDs fit the allocated slots.

